%% §21 machine 2 of 8 — Campaign Brief  (Prisma enum: BriefState)
%% §21: DRAFT -> QUALIFIED -> APPROVED -> CAMPAIGN_CREATED -> CLOSED
    direction TB
    [*] --> DRAFT : sponsor starts a brief
    DRAFT --> QUALIFIED : BTG sales qualifies it
    QUALIFIED --> APPROVED : budget and targeting agreed
    APPROVED --> CAMPAIGN_CREATED : campaign record opened (1:1)
    CAMPAIGN_CREATED --> CLOSED : campaign finished or abandoned
    CLOSED --> [*]

    note right of CAMPAIGN_CREATED
      Phase 1 is a managed marketplace: qualification
      and approval are BTG staff actions, not checkout.
    end note
